sequenceDiagram
  participant Client
  participant API
  participant Cache
  participant DB as Database
  Client->>API: Get product
  API->>Cache: Lookup key
  alt Cache hit
    Cache-->>API: Cached value
  else Cache miss
    Cache-->>API: Not found
    API->>DB: Read product
    DB-->>API: Product row
    API->>Cache: Store with TTL
  end
  API-->>Client: Product
